---
description: AC-3 specifics for case-intake-api.
globs: src/routes/**/*.ts, src/services/**/*.ts, tests/api/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---
- In this repo the scoped fetch is findCaseForExaminer(id, examinerId) in
  src/services/cases.ts. Use it; never query prisma.case directly from a route.
- Deny tests go in tests/api/ and use examiner-a and examiner-b from prisma/seed.ts.
- Do not edit prisma/schema.prisma. Record the denial route in the existing
  action string, for example access-denied GET /cases/1042. Do not add a column.
- Run npm test before reporting done.
